00:32:49.884 --> 00:32:51.909
MAN [O VER PHONE]:
<i>No, I don't know, dude.</i>


00:32:52.086 --> 00:32:53.553
<i>I haven't seen a boob in three years.</i>


00:32:53.721 --> 00:32:54.745
[MERT SINGING]


00:32:54.922 --> 00:32:56.048
<i>It was at the pool.</i>


00:32:56.224 --> 00:32:57.851
