00:33:02.530 --> 00:33:04.521
[JAN GIGGLING]


00:33:05.633 --> 00:33:07.624
[SINGING "TOO MARVELOUS FOR WORDS"]


00:33:08.603 --> 00:33:09.592
[GIGGLES]


00:33:09.771 --> 00:33:11.762
[SINGING]


00:33:15.009 --> 00:33:16.135
Oh, Mert. Oh!


00:33:16.310 --> 00:33:19.177
MERT: I'm having my way with you.
