00:33:19.347 --> 00:33:20.814
[JAN YELLING, MERT HUMMING]


00:33:20.982 --> 00:33:23.746
<i>Dude, what's going on?</i>
<i>Who's headed for the bedroom?</i>


00:33:23.918 --> 00:33:26.819
- Oh, Mert. Oh, Mert. Oh, honey.
