00:33:26.988 --> 00:33:30.253
MERT: Your thighs are like a bear trap.
- Ugh!


00:33:30.425 --> 00:33:32.416
JAN:
Oh... Oh!


00:33:33.895 --> 00:33:35.692
[SINGING]
<i>And everything's sponsored</i>


00:33:35.863 --> 00:33:37.888
<i>By huge corporations</i>


00:33:38.232 --> 00:33:42.896
<i>What will be next?</i>
<i>A Del Taco space station</i>


00:33:43.271 --> 00:33:44.431
[CHATTERING]


00:33:44.605 --> 00:33:48.666
