00:36:00.208 --> 00:36:04.008
And that's why I hate this city, you know?
Because it's all a bunch of posers.


00:36:04.178 --> 00:36:06.772
And I just feel like
as soon as I get enough money...


00:36:06.948 --> 00:36:09.849
