because I can't stand it anymore.


00:36:10.017 --> 00:36:12.485
- Do you wanna sit here? This good?
- Oh, sure.


00:36:12.653 --> 00:36:14.951
Well, where are you gonna go?


00:36:15.122 --> 00:36:17.750
I think I'm gonna go to Austin, Texas.


00:36:17.959 --> 00:36:19.119
I wanna check it out.


00:36:19.293 --> 00:36:22.160
It's got this really,
really cool indie music scene there.


00:36:22.563 --> 00:36:24.531
Have you been there?


00:36:25.466 --> 00:36:29.903
Actually, I did go there one summer,
for an astronomy conference...


00:36:30.071 --> 00:36:33.040
...but I usually try to avoid
trips like that whenever possible.


00:36:33.574 --> 00:36:36.509
Why? You don't really like to travel?


00:36:36.711 --> 00:36:40.511
Unfortunately, my mother's ill
and needs my constant attention.


00:36:40.681 --> 00:36:45.015
Oh. That's really, really cool
that you take care of her.


00:36:45.186 --> 00:36:48.178
Yeah. It's my cross to bear.


00:36:48.356 --> 00:36:50.916
Well, that really sucks
that you have to live at home.


00:36:51.092 --> 00:36:55.961
Well, at least it affords me the financial
freedom to pursue my life's work.


00:36:56.130 --> 00:36:59.827
For the last seven years,
I've been tracking what I believe to be...


00:37:00.001 --> 00:37:03.835
...a long-period comet
which emanates from the Oort cloud.


00:37:04.338 --> 00:37:06.329
That's cool.


00:37:06.707 --> 00:37:08.004
Oort.


00:37:10.578 --> 00:37:12.239
TRIP:
What's up, Nora?


00:37:12.413 --> 00:37:14.472
What do you want, Trip?


00:37:14.649 --> 00:37:18.676
- I'd like a tall latte, extra hot.
- Heh-heh-heh.


00:37:18.853 --> 00:37:21.344
- That's a good one, Trip.
- Ha-ha-ha.


00:37:21.522 --> 00:37:23.922
Yes, Trip. Very clever.


00:37:25.293 --> 00:37:28.285
I've seen you before.
You work at that bookstore, right?


00:37:28.462 --> 00:37:30.225
Yes, I do.


00:37:30.398 --> 00:37:33.492
Well, that's messed up, bro.
That place is, like, old...


00:37:33.668 --> 00:37:35.397
...and shit.


00:37:35.569 --> 00:37:38.504
Wow, you have a real gift for language.


00:37:38.673 --> 00:37:41.767
I'm shocked you had to
pilfer your lyrics off the Internet.


00:37:44.845 --> 00:37:48.110
- Screw you, dude.
- Jeffrey. Come on, let's get out of here.


00:37:51.018 --> 00:37:53.486
- You was a ho, anyway.
PUNK: Oh! Ooh!


00:37:53.654 --> 00:37:55.519
It doesn't matter.


00:37:56.757 --> 00:37:57.951
What did you call her?


00:37:58.326 --> 00:38:00.590
I called her a bizznatch.


00:38:03.297 --> 00:38:04.662
Aah!


00:38:05.433 --> 00:38:07.833
- Oh!
- Ah! Trip!


00:38:08.002 --> 00:38:09.663
- Oh, oh.
NORA: Are you okay?


00:38:10.705 --> 00:38:12.138
I'm hemorrhaging.


00:38:12.940 --> 00:38:14.805
You haven't heard the last of me!


00:38:14.976 --> 00:38:17.467
I'll sue you, you monster!


00:38:17.645 --> 00:38:20.443
Hurry. Get a napkin, stat.


00:38:20.614 --> 00:38:22.912
I think I may be a hemophiliac.


00:38:24.118 --> 00:38:26.552
NORA:
So is your nose okay?


00:38:26.721 --> 00:38:30.020
JEFFREY:
I think that barbarian broke it.


00:38:30.191 --> 00:38:32.625
Hey, cool. Whose hybrid?


00:38:32.793 --> 00:38:35.853
That's my mother's beau du jour.


00:38:36.030 --> 00:38:38.794
MERT: This is Mert again.
- Speak of the devil.


00:38:39.667 --> 00:38:41.760
