We're having a family picnic.


00:39:18.439 --> 00:39:20.202
- No, we're not.
- Actually, we are.


00:39:20.374 --> 00:39:23.935
I decided to do something special
for your mother's half-birthday.


00:39:24.111 --> 00:39:26.079
You must've forgotten.


00:39:26.247 --> 00:39:30.741
I am far too busy to keep track
