00:39:38.292 --> 00:39:41.750
Well, actually, I'd really like to go.


00:39:42.730 --> 00:39:44.163
See?


00:39:44.331 --> 00:39:45.992
[CHUCKLES]


00:39:46.233 --> 00:39:47.996
All right.


00:39:48.803 --> 00:39:50.998
What are you guys gonna do now?


00:39:51.872 --> 00:39:53.100
[CHUCKLES]


00:39:53.274 --> 00:39:54.866
